Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Source: https://winaero.com/how-to-show-or-hide-windows-defender-tray-icon-in-windows-10/
; Older Winaero registry method: remove Run values named "Windows Defender".
; Modern Winaero instructions use Task Manager Startup instead.

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run]
"Windows Defender"=-

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Run]
"Windows Defender"=-
